{"schemaVersion":1,"records":[["open-nalan-19063a38bd5ce5e7cbab","詞",["雄關險要阻塞處，宛如靈鰲負戴而立。","此地控制盧龍，其險勝過百牢關。","山巒界線萬重，橫亙著翠綠的山色。","大海環繞三面，湧起如銀色的巨浪。","悲涼的笳聲伴隨月光傳來，聲調格外淒切。","早歸的大雁迎著秋意飛過，身影高遠。","昔日這裡曾是六軍開闢的險要之處，","如今等待陪伴君王巡幸，護衞著星形的旌旗。"],"b2972ca7a8a0acf49c4853ff06cd69a59b5e9739e0bdc172becda3d40abb5ce7",{"quality":"machine-draft-unreviewed","status":"pending-review","sourceLabel":"Leafbound AI 今譯 · 初步可用","displayStatus":"待人工校訂","productionReady":false,"model":"Qwen3.5-9B-Local","modelRevision":"local-deployment-2026-08-29","promptVersion":"leafbound-classical-v2","warnings":[],"generatedAt":"2026-08-29T12:16:23.331Z","editorialTriage":"initially-usable","review":{"reviewer":"Leafbound owner","reviewedAt":"2026-08-29T14:00:00.000Z","note":"初步抽查通過；仍待逐篇精校。"}}]]}
